SITIONS AND SUPPORT.  THE EA PROGRAMS INCREASES THE CAPABILITY OF FRA TO PERFORM ITS MISSION IN THE MOST EFFICIENT AND COST EFFECTIVE WAY.  IT GOVERNANCE SERVICES INVOLVES CONTRACTOR SUPPORT TO ASSIST FRA IN THE OPERATION OF ITS ENTERPRISE ARCHITECTURE, IT CAPITAL PLANNING AND OTHER IT GOVERNANCE SUPPORT PROGRAMS.  THE EA PROGRAM MODELS FRA UNDER THE OVERARCHING FRAMEWORKS OF THE FEDERAL ENTERPRISE ARCHITECTURE FRAMEWORK (FEAF) AND THE OMB FEA MODEL.  IT CAPITAL PLANNING AND OTHER IT GOVERNANCE SUPPORT INCLUDES PLANNING, SELECTING, CONTROLLING, AND EVALUATING INVESTMENTS.  IT ALSO INVOLVES PROVIDING ASSISTANCE TO PROJECT MANAGERS WITH EXHIBIT 300S, EXHIBIT 53, CAPITAL PLANNING TEMPLATES.","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Transportation","awarding_agency_id":731,"agency_slug":"department-of-transportation","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_DTFR5317F00021_6930_GS10F0325Y_4732"},{"internal_id":278743038,"Award ID":"19AQMM22F7148","Award Amount":96915.6,"Description":"THIS IS A BPA CALL FOR MANAGEMENT SUPPORT SERVICES, AN ANALYSIS OF ALTERNATIVES","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of State","awarding_agency_id":315,"agency_slug":"department-of-state","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_19AQMM22F7148_1900_19AQMM19A0234_1900"},{"internal_id":349154434,"Award ID":"W81XWH18F0251","Award Amount":96932.41,"Description":"FY18 BMFRP SUPPORT","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of Defense","awarding_agency_id":1173,"agency_slug":"department-of-defense","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_W81XWH18F0251_9700_W81XWH17D0025_9700"},{"internal_id":277791107,"Award ID":"140G0122F0229","Award Amount":96985.37,"Description":"CHEROKEE NATION -  GENERAL BIOLOGIST III","generated_unique_award_id":null,"Awarding Agency":"Department of the Interior","awarding_agency_id":209,"agency_slug":"department-of-the-interior","generated_internal_id":"CONT_AWD_140G0122F0229_1434_140G0120D0021_1434"},{"internal_id":29162